  "description": "MAWTIO crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C150 H112 Nd4 O22. From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd1A (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd2A (Nd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.861-3.988 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.42-108.82°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C150H112Nd4O22. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
